le\":{\"text\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The toys are back in Disney and Pixar’s “Toy Story 5,” and this time around it’s Toy meets Tech. Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang’s jobs get exponentially harder when they go head to head with this all-new threat to playtime.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The toys are back in Disney and Pixar’s “Toy Story 5,” and this time around it’s Toy meets Tech. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":102,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/3e6d64d4-c466-4c58-93cd-ce8d7c41f210/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GM3Dmn06fy8\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GM3Dmn06fy8\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002191\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005692\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006291\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009763\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013297\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013298\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013315\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013316\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002191\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003325\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005692\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006291\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009763\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013314\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013297\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013315\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013298\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013316\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000007\",\"0000000025\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3e6d64d4-c466-4c58-93cd-ce8d7c41f210\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006825\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008421\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006931\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Disclosure Day\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you? This June, the truth belongs to seven billion people.\\n\\nWe are coming close to … Disclosure Day.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"If you found out we weren’t alone, if someone showed you, proved it to you, would that frighten you? This June, the truth belongs to seven billion people.\\n\\nWe are coming.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":145,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/920be864-1bc7-4cfd-aa64-b828b3c90b38/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFz8czbdPdU\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFz8czbdPdU\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000418\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001072\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002139\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013627\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000341\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000418\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001072\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008293\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000013627\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002138\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002139\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000035\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"920be864-1bc7-4cfd-aa64-b828b3c90b38\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006931\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008544\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007012\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Moana\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Disney’s live-action adaptation of the beloved Oscar®-nominated animated adventure, Moana (Catherine Lagaʻaia) answers the Ocean’s call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with the infamous demigod Maui (Dwayne Johnson) on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people. The film is directed by Emmy® and Tony Award® winner Thomas Kail (“Hamilton”); produced by Dwayne Johnson, Dany Garcia, Beau Flynn, Hiram Garcia and Lin-Manuel Miranda; and executive produced by Thomas Kail, Scott Sheldon, Charles Newirth and Auliʻi Cravalho, who voiced Moana in the animated features “Moana” and “Moana 2.”\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In Disney’s live-action adaptation of the beloved Oscar®-nominated animated adventure, Moana (Catherine Lagaʻaia) answers the Ocean’s call and, for the first time, voyage\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":120,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/a7437e11-b6d4-476f-89ac-5a3a2ee813c8/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JnficPHHF2U\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JnficPHHF2U\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000371\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001009\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001016\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001017\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001018\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007576\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011016\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011017\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011018\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011019\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001009\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007576\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011016\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011017\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011018\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011019\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000371\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001009\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001016\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001017\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001018\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000003\",\"0000000007\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a7437e11-b6d4-476f-89ac-5a3a2ee813c8\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007012\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008640\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007049\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Supergirl\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"When an unexpected and ruthless adversary strikes too close to home, Kara Zor-El, aka Supergirl, reluctantly joins forces with an unlikely companion on an epic, interstellar journey of vengeance and justice.\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"It follows Kara Zor-El's story and her darker origin before she finally made her way to Earth.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000004\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-25\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":108,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/2b0aa4dc-1774-403d-9a32-6d9b77e84fc1/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GMhydAtN5dM\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GMhydAtN5dM\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000264\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000268\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000579\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000840\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001692\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004204\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005723\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011591\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014008\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000264\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001692\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004204\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005723\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011591\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014008\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000268\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000579\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000840\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000007\",\"0000000035\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2b0aa4dc-1774-403d-9a32-6d9b77e84fc1\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007049\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008688\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Warners\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007116\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Odyssey\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Legendary filmmaker Christopher Nolan follows up his Oscar-winning sensation Oppenheimer with another rousing epic, The Odyssey, whose all-star cast includes Matt Damon, Tom Holland, Anne Hathaway, Robert Pattinson, Lupita Nyong'o, Zendaya and Charlize Theron.\\n\\nThis mythic action movie recounts the story of Odysseus (Damon) on his perilous journey home, troubled by gods and monsters. Meanwhile, his wife Penelope (Hathaway) and son Telemachus (Holland) fight to hold their kingdom together against relentless suitors.\\n\\nSee it on 35mm film at Soho, and enjoy it with Dolby Atmos sound at Bloomsbury, Canterbury Riverside and Kingston.\\n\\nTHE ODYSSEY MIDNIGHT SCREENINGS\\nThe film will start promptly at 12:01am on Thursday night. Please ensure you are seated by midnight.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Christopher Nolan’s next film, The Odyssey, is a mythic action epic shot across the world using brand new IMAX® film technology. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-17\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":172,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"Moviexchange\",\"uri\":\"https://film-cdn.moviexchange.com/api/cdn/release/b3ff6b75-3025-43b7-88a5-37fc8c43d313/media/TrailerVideo\"},{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sk6LZrA2JSQ\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sk6LZrA2JSQ\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000319\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000680\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001061\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002220\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002609\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003850\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004443\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005731\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014094\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000319\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000680\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001061\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002220\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002609\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"00