 we're inviting you to experience his greatest films on the big screen. Season curated by Claire Nicolas and Marc David Jacobs. \\n\\nMIDNIGHT COWBOY\\nA naive hustler travels from Texas to New York City to seek personal fortune but, in the process, finds himself a new friend.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A naive hustler travels from Texas to New York City to seek personal fortune but, in the process, finds himself a new friend.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"Sexual violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-05\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":111,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qI-KezdGj0E\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qI-KezdGj0E\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008227\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009665\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011662\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000726\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000727\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000728\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000729\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000730\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000731\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008227\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009665\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000726\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000727\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000728\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000729\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000730\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011662\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000731\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007105\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008752\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Park Circus\"},{\"id\":\"HO00007181\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"WHAM! 10 Days in China\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"In 1985, WHAM! made history as the first Western pop act to perform in communist China. George Michael and Andrew Ridgeley’s concerts in Beijing and Guangzhou were a cultural milestone – East meets West, music meets politics. Now, newly restored footage reveals the untold story of the iconic tour that helped launch WHAM! to global superstardom.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"In 1985, WHAM! crossed cultural divides as the first Western pop act in China. Previously unseen, beautifully restored archive footage reveals this landmark meeting\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-28\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":90,\"trailers\":[{\"provider\":\"External\",\"uri\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P7oAaJqqv8w\"}],\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P7oAaJqqv8w\",\"displayPriority\":5,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006189\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006191\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014237\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014238\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"actors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006189\"},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006191\"}],\"directors\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014237\"}],\"producers\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000014238\"}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\",\"0000000031\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"2cf0e845-3544-444c-b11e-50d2bfd4d480\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00007181\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008836\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Trafalgar Releasing\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000008227\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Dustin\",\"familyName\":\"Hoffman\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000009665\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jon\",\"familyName\":\"Voight\",\"middl